  },
  "privacySecurityText": "The security measures implemented to guarantee the security of personal data correspond to those set out in Annex II (Security measures) of Real Decreto 311/2022, de 3 de mayo (Royal Decree 311/2022, of May 3), which regulates the National Security Framework (Esquema Nacional de Seguridad).",
